            <title>[LU-20811] ptlrpc: ptlrpc_request_free() before pack leaks the import reference</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20811</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;ptlrpc_request_alloc() takes an import reference (class_import_get()) and increments&lt;br/&gt;
imp_reqs. ptlrpc_request_free() drops neither. If a caller frees the request before&lt;br/&gt;
ptlrpc_request_pack(), both leak. The import is then never destroyed and never goes idle.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20050" title="ptlrpc: fix sepol error handling in ptlrpc_connect_import_locked" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20050"&gt;LU-20050&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20546" title="ptlrpc: import reference leaked or double-released on setup failure" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20546"&gt;LU-20546&lt;/a&gt; fixed the sepol and pack-failure cases. Some pre-pack exits in&lt;br/&gt;
osc_brw_prep_request() still leak:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;  - the encryption folio array allocation, obd_pool_get_folios_array(), and the per-page&lt;br/&gt;
    encryption failure&lt;br/&gt;
  - cl_env_get() failure&lt;br/&gt;
  - cl_object_attr_get() failure&lt;br/&gt;
  - the -ENODATA exit for an empty RPC to an old server&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Possible fix: when rq_import is still set, let ptlrpc_request_free() itself decrement&lt;br/&gt;
imp_reqs and call class_import_put(). After &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20546" title="ptlrpc: import reference leaked or double-released on setup failure" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20546"&gt;LU-20546&lt;/a&gt;, a pack failure clears rq_import, so&lt;br/&gt;
callers that free after a failed pack stay correct. This needs an audit of all&lt;br/&gt;
ptlrpc_request_free() callers. It would also remove the open-coded put in&lt;br/&gt;
ptlrpc_request_alloc_internal().&lt;br/&gt;
  &lt;br/&gt;
Found during review of &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/68582" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/68582&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20546" title="ptlrpc: import reference leaked or double-released on setup failure" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20546"&gt;LU-20546&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
